<title>USA: FSI Intl completes private placements.</title>
<headline>FSI Intl completes private placements.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSI International Inc said Friday it completed a private placement of $30 million of 7.15 percent senior unsecured notes due 2004 and $12 million of 7.27 percent senior unsecured notes due 2006.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to acquire equipment for demonstration, product and general corporate purposes. A portion may be used for strategic acquisitions.</p>
<p>FSI supplies capital equipment used to manufacture microelectronics.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
